## Key Decisions
- Picked slate-200 (#E2E8F0) for outer and slate-100 (#F1F5F9) for inner accents — gives clean "slate-grey" feel without losing readability against the white card and blue (#245F73) header.
- Header (#245F73 teal-blue) and CTA buttons left untouched per user spec.
- Decoupled Prepay Fee from Prepay Period (previously Fee auto-set Period). Kept a thin coupling: "No Prepay" on either side syncs the other, so we never end up with `Fee=5%, Period=No Prepay` (invalid).
- Default values unchanged: `prepayType='3pct'`, `prepayPeriod='36mo'` (Investor Details opens at Fee=3%, Period=3 Year).

