## Technical Notes
- Investor Details section is gated by `showInvestorDetails = formData.occupancyType === 'investment'` (src/App.tsx:1817). Both Prepay fields live inside that conditional, so they only render for Investment.
- `prepayPeriod` values are stored as `"<n>mo"` strings (60mo, 48mo, 36mo, 24mo, 12mo, 0mo). The pricing engine's `matchesPrepayPeriod()` (src/App.tsx:1895) reads these to filter eligible programs.
- Small-balance loan validation (src/App.tsx:1342) requires `prepayPeriod >= 24` for loans under $100K — adding 12mo/24mo as new selectable options is compatible with that gate.
- Email HTML lives inline in `src/App.tsx` (~lines 390–820) and `api/flash-submit-request.ts` (~line 184). There are no separate email template files — search by hex code if updating brand colors.
- Browser test confirmed: occupancy=Investment shows both fields; occupancy=Primary hides both; bidirectional sync works in both directions.

